{"summary":"Uncover dark secrets and solve puzzles in this terrifying Indian horror game!","description":"★★★ NIGHTMARE MODE IS LIVE ★★★\n\nStep into the eerie world of Kamla's Exorcism, a chilling survival horror game set in 1980s India. Play as a Tantrik Priest tasked with saving a newlywed woman, Kamla, who has become possessed by a dangerous demon. Can you solve ancient puzzles, face her wrath, and perform the exorcism ritual in time?\n\nKey Features:\n\n• Indian Horror Experience: Set in a mysterious mansion in 1980s India, uncover family secrets and encounter supernatural events as you attempt to help Kamla break free from the demon’s control.\n\n• Exorcism Rituals & Puzzles: Search the house for ritual items needed for the exorcism. Solve puzzles to unlock hidden objects and navigate obstacles. Stay alert—Kamla will resist.\n\n• Survival Horror Gameplay: As a Tantrik priest, you must rely on your instincts and speed. Evade Kamla when she’s aggressive and find places to hide, while holding on to the sacred items you've gathered. Each decision matters.\n\n• Atmospheric 1980s Setting: The game recreates the feel of rural India in the 1980s, with detailed visuals and ambient sounds that build tension as you explore the haunted mansion.\n\n• Sound Design & Scary Encounters: Experience intense moments as Kamla’s demon takes control. The ambient soundtrack and sound effects are designed to enhance the feeling of dread.","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Horror","iapPrices":"$0.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/2pjU7T_O8zM?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ye0aehuRD2QP8fSvCZbO-KgKUklK5dH9ZU5ONXjAj-vbvea2uTbo2szAmaGc7orEfYC6BMiIqSXaOO-lZD7w4Bo","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xrSNjOm1piefZqdO_I5P-OTt4Os4kHtD9WVEmCC5orE0eDlH1gjSNLWqXWIRgPMsB8_zL2FxgNOGbzNng2WR","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pv0JcNSFI0lT_yE45tsESwCT0VC7AuDUEaAW6Ef23m6t8kXl36aHf0BOe7P3MilR5WLLAfM